@*
    Privacy Policy — English text. Counterpart of _PrivacyBody.tr.cshtml.

    Kept as a whole document rather than resx keys on purpose: legal text is reviewed
    section by section, sentences depend on one another, and the two language versions
    may legitimately diverge in structure over time.

    Substantive parity with the Turkish version is REQUIRED. In particular these must
    always appear in both: Firebase Analytics, Firebase Crashlytics, the statement that
    no advertising identifier (IDFA) is used and no ad tracking takes place, the in-app
    data export and account deletion rights, and the last-updated date (rendered by
    Privacy.cshtml from the "privacy.lastUpdated" resource).
*@
<p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
    At Somine, the security of your personal data matters a great deal to us. This Privacy
    Policy explains which data is collected when you use the Somine mobile application (the
    &quot;App&quot;), how that data is used, and how it is protected. By using the App you are
    deemed to have accepted this policy.
</p>

<div class="bg-[#E8F1EF] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#688E8B]/10">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">
        Notice under Turkish data protection law (KVKK)
    </h3>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        This privacy policy has been prepared in accordance with Turkish Law No. 6698 on the
        Protection of Personal Data (KVKK) and its related legislation. Your personal data is
        processed according to the principles and rules laid down by the KVKK.
    </p>
</div>

<div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#688E8B]/10 text-[#688E8B] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">1</span>
        Data We Collect
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        We may collect the following data while you use the Somine app:
    </p>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-500">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Account information:</strong> your name, email address, profile photo, and the information supplied through social sign-in accounts (Apple, Google).
            </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Usage data:</strong> your interactions inside the app, the collections you create, the items you add, and the categories you prefer.
            </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Device information:</strong> device type, operating system version, app version, and unique device identifier.
            </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Log data:</strong> app usage statistics, crash reports, and performance data.
            </div>
        </li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#688E8B]/10 text-[#688E8B] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">2</span>
        Why We Use Your Data
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        The data we collect is used for the following purposes:
    </p>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-500">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            Providing the core functions of the app and managing your collections
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            Improving and personalising the user experience
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            Diagnosing technical problems and keeping the app secure
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            Managing Premium subscriptions and handling billing
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            Meeting our legal obligations
        </li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#688E8B]/10 text-[#688E8B] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">3</span>
        Cookies and Similar Technologies
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
        The Somine app may use cookies and similar tracking technologies to improve the user
        experience. These technologies are used to remember your session, store your preferences
        and gather usage statistics. You can manage your cookie preferences from the app settings.
        On somineapp.com we additionally set one strictly necessary cookie that remembers your
        language choice; it is never used for advertising or tracking.
    </p>
</div>

<div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#688E8B]/10 text-[#688E8B] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">4</span>
        Third-Party Services
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Somine uses the following third-party services:
    </p>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-500">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Firebase:</strong> user authentication, data storage and app infrastructure. Firebase is provided by Google LLC and processes data on secure servers.
            </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Firebase Analytics:</strong> collects usage data so we can understand how the app is used (which screens are opened, which features are used, how often sessions occur). This data is reviewed in aggregate to improve the product. <strong class="text-gray-900">No advertising identifier (IDFA) is used, and no tracking for advertising purposes takes place.</strong>
            </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Firebase Crashlytics:</strong> collects diagnostic data when the app closes unexpectedly (the error record, device model, operating system version). Its sole purpose is to identify and fix faults.
            </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900">RevenueCat:</strong> Premium subscription management, purchase validation and billing. RevenueCat manages your subscription status securely.
            </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Apple Sign-In:</strong> Apple's authentication service for signing in. Apple shares only your name and email address.
            </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Google Sign-In:</strong> Google's authentication service for signing in. Your basic profile information is verified through Google.
            </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900">Apple App Store / Google Play:</strong> Premium subscription purchases. Payments are processed directly by Apple or Google.
            </div>
        </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mt-4">
        Each of these services is governed by its own privacy policy, and Somine is not
        responsible for the data-processing practices of third-party services.
    </p>
</div>

<div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#688E8B]/10 text-[#688E8B] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">5</span>
        Data Security
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
        We apply industry-standard security measures to protect your personal data. Your data is
        transmitted with SSL/TLS encryption and stored on secure servers. The Hidden Vault feature
        is protected by Face ID and Touch ID biometric authentication; only you can access those
        collections. That said, no transmission of data over the internet can be guaranteed to be
        100% secure.
    </p>
</div>

<div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#688E8B]/10 text-[#688E8B] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">6</span>
        Your Rights (KVKK)
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Under the KVKK you have the following rights:
    </p>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-500">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            To learn whether your personal data is being processed
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            To request information about that processing, if your personal data has been processed
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            To request correction where your personal data has been processed incompletely or incorrectly
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            To request deletion of your personal data, within the conditions set out in Article 7 of the KVKK
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            To request that any processing be notified to third parties
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#688E8B] mt-2 shrink-0"></span>
            To object where processing produces a result to your detriment
        </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mt-4">
        <strong class="text-gray-900">You can manage your data from inside the app:</strong>
        the <em>&quot;Export your data&quot;</em> option on the Profile screen lets you download
        all of your items and collections as JSON or CSV. The <em>&quot;Delete Account&quot;</em>
        option on the same screen permanently erases your account and all of your data — this
        cannot be undone, and you do not need to send us a request to do it.
    </p>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mt-4">
        To exercise these rights, you can email us at
        <a href="mailto:support@somineapp.com" class="text-[#688E8B] hover:underline font-medium">
            support@somineapp.com
        </a>.
    </p>
</div>

<div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#688E8B]/10 text-[#688E8B] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">7</span>
        How Long We Keep Your Data
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
        Your personal data is retained for as long as your account is active. When you delete your
        account, or if you do not use it for an extended period, your data will be deleted except
        where we are legally obliged to keep it. Some data may be retained for longer where the law
        requires it.
    </p>
</div>

<div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#688E8B]/10 text-[#688E8B] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">8</span>
        Children's Privacy
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
        Somine does not knowingly collect personal data from children under the age of 13. If you
        become aware that personal data of a child under 13 has been collected, please contact us.
    </p>
</div>

<div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#688E8B]/10 text-[#688E8B] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">9</span>
        Changes to This Policy
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Where changes are significant, we will
        notify you inside the app. You can check the &quot;Last updated&quot; date at the top of this
        page to see when the policy was last revised.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#688E8B]/5 to-[#688E8B]/5 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#688E8B]/10 mt-8">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">
        Contact
    </h3>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        If you have questions or requests about our privacy policy, you can get in touch with us:
    </p>
    <a href="mailto:support@somineapp.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-3 text-[#688E8B] hover:underline font-medium text-sm">
